        "message": "=<div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;max-width:480px;margin:auto;text-align:center\"><h2>Your Event Pass 🎟️</h2><p>Hi {{ $('Build QR Data').first().json.fullName }}, show this QR code at the entrance to check in.</p><img src=\"{{ $('Build QR Data').first().json.qrImageUrl }}\" alt=\"QR code\" width=\"260\" height=\"260\"><p><b>{{ $('Build QR Data').first().json.participantId }}</b></p><p>{{ $('Build QR Data').first().json.eventName }}<br>{{ $('Build QR Data').first().json.eventVenue }}</p><p style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px\">If the image is hidden, choose 'Display images below' in your mail app.</p></div>",
